1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,920
-再往这边来一点 再来点 -好的
- Just a little bit more. A little bit more. - Okay, all right.

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:05,800
然后...
And...

3
00:00:05,907 --> 00:00:07,047
惊喜哦
Surprise!

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:10,100
来跟"启示3000"打个招呼吧
Say hello to the Revelation 3000,

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,480
目前市场上最先进的智能冰箱
the most advanced smart fridge on the market.

6
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:14,020
我感觉我们没钱去买
Something tells me we can't afford

7
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,838
黛安娜·罗斯在大庄家赌场酒店的演出票了
to see Diana Ross at Pechanga anymore.

8
00:00:15,838 --> 00:00:18,115
接下来是最棒的部分 准备好了吗
Ooh, here's the best part. You ready?

9
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,140
你好 布丽吉特
Hello, Bridget.

10
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:21,220
你好 有什么能效劳的
Hello, how can I help?

11
00:00:21,349 --> 00:00:23,500
布丽吉特是人工智能助理
Bridget is the A.I. Assistant

12
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,880
可以帮忙整理杂货
that will help organize our groceries

13
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:26,120
和我们的生活
and our lives.

14
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:28,120
她已经帮我创建一个播放清单了
She's already created me a playlist,

15
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,318
帮我把日历同步了
she's synced my calendars,

16
00:00:29,318 --> 00:00:31,104
她还创建了明星八卦提醒...
she created a celebrity gossip alert...

17
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:32,940
说到八卦...
Speaking of gossip --

18
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:35,040
你听说胡娇夫夫的事了吗
Did you hear about Pepper and Ronaldo?

19
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:35,900
没有 怎么了
No, what?

20
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,560
传闻是 他们最近邀请了
Word is, they recently invited

21
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:40,340
一个第三方加入到他们的感情关系中
a third party into their relationship.

22
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:42,960
-那个男人是谁 -不是男的 是女的
- Who is he? - You mean, who is she.

23
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:46,680
怎么会 我都不知道他们认识女人啊
How?! I didn't even know they knew any women!

24
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:49,160
显然 他们是在一个实验性相亲网站上认识她的
Apparently, they met her on an experimental dating site

25
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:50,820
那网站叫"缘分发展天注定"
called "Let's Just See What Happens."

26
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:52,900
是我的提醒
Oh, oh, that's me.

27
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:54,577
我得快点走了
Oh, I gotta run.

28
00:00:54,577 --> 00:00:56,120
我今天要连续开两场会
I got back-to-back meetings today

29
00:00:56,120 --> 00:00:57,697
晚上还要参加聚餐
and then I got a team dinner tonight.

30
00:00:57,697 --> 00:00:59,660
小卡 你...又要聚餐吗
Cam, no you -- Another one?

31
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:01,280
-那已经是你这周第三次聚餐了 -是啊
- That's your third one this week. - Yeah.

32
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:03,920
我今天也很忙 谢谢你的过问啊
I also have a busy day, thank you for asking.

33
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:05,880
今天很忙吗
Busy day?

34
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:08,820
如果我帮你订购你最爱的杂货 能帮到你吗
Would it be helpful if I ordered some of your favorite groceries?

35
00:01:08,869 --> 00:01:10,900
你 你可以做到吗
You -- You can do that?

36
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:12,660
谢谢你...
Thank you...

37
00:01:13,060 --> 00:01:13,560
我叫布丽吉特
Bridget.

38
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:15,160
谢谢你 布丽吉特
Thank you, Bridget.

39
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:17,680
你前面有说要买更多的胡椒吗
Did I hear you say you need more pepper?

40
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:19,909
不是 胡娇是我们的一个朋友
Oh, no, Pepper's just a friend.

41
00:01:19,909 --> 00:01:22,400
如果小卡刚刚不是急着离开
And if Cam wasn't in such a rush to get out of here,

42
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:25,480
我们就能谈谈他在做一件多么疯狂的事了
we'd be talking about what an insane thing he's doing.

43
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:28,220
几乎和跟家电说话一样疯狂
Almost as insane as talking to an appliance.

44
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:30,400
你刚刚似乎提到了第三方
You mentioned a third party?

45
00:01:32,340 --> 00:01:35,200
讲真 谁会把网上刚认识的人
Yeah, honestly, who just meets someone online

46
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:37,220
邀请到家里来住啊
and then invites them into their house?

47
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:52,400
然后我会向客户们展示
And then I would show the client

48
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:54,420
过去一年有比较性的已售房屋
comparable sales from the past year.

49
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:58,320
我布置的作业 是呈现一个吸引人的销售推介
The assignment was to present a compelling sales pitch,

50
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:01,360
不是用无止尽的房地产陈腔滥调把我无聊死
not bore me with endless real-estate cliches.

51
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:03,500
你为何 夫人...
What gives, Mrs...

52
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:04,340
普里契特夫人
Mrs. Pritchett?

53
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:07,740
我没有...
Oh, I didn't...

54
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:08,320
你要如何...
What would you...?

55
00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:09,949
你要如何...
What would you...?

56
00:02:09,949 --> 00:02:12,647
不好意思 你这也算是句子吗
I'm sorry, are -- are -- are those sentences?

57
00:02:13,180 --> 00:02:14,160
为何要这么严苛
Why so harsh?

58
00:02:14,700 --> 00:02:17,679
因为歌洛莉亚在这方面有独特的天赋
Because Gloria's gift is that special.

59
00:02:17,679 --> 00:02:20,480
堪称划时代的房地产天才
A generational real-estate talent.

60
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:22,080
我必须狠狠地逼她更优秀才行
I have to push her that hard.

61
00:02:22,180 --> 00:02:24,820
她也希望我这么做 优秀的学生都希望这样
She wants me to. All the great ones do.

62
00:02:25,018 --> 00:02:28,115
菲尔对我太刻薄了
Phil is so mean to me.

63
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,460
17926号安全与健康法规
Health and Safety Code 17926.

64
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:31,840
一氧化碳警报
Carbon monoxide alarm!

65
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,499
12955号政府法规
Government Code 12955.

66
00:02:33,499 --> 00:02:35,030
多家庭住所
Multi-family dwellings!

67
00:02:35,030 --> 00:02:37,242
《民法》第1101.1条
Civil Code 1101.1.

68
00:02:37,242 --> 00:02:38,260
管道
Plumbing!

69
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:39,240
不对 是固定装置
No, fixtures!

70
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,630
-等等 是... -你落后了
- Wait, it's -- - You're dragging.

71
00:02:41,630 --> 00:02:43,127
-我知道 -莉比 说
- Ooh, I know it! - Libby, go!

72
00:02:43,127 --> 00:02:45,860
《民法》第1101.1条要求1994年之前
Civil Code 1101.1 requires plumbing re-installment

73
00:02:45,860 --> 00:02:47,940
建造的所有住宅中都要重新安装水管
of all residential properties built before 1994.

74
00:02:48,260 --> 00:02:48,880
正确
Yes!

75
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,900
某人认真听讲了哦
Someone is paying attention.

76
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:52,016
很难不认真听
It's hard not to.

77
00:02:52,016 --> 00:02:53,800
你关于房产法规的说唱式课程
Your rap-lectures on property codes

78
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,340
既包含了各种信息 又有放克风
are both informative and funky.

79
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,760
我注意到你的杯子丢了
Oh, I noticed that you lost your mug,

80
00:02:57,760 --> 00:03:00,360
于是我给你买了个新的
so I just went ahead, got you a new one.

81
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:00,910
塑料的吗
Plastic?

82
00:03:00,910 --> 00:03:03,420
她一定是想搞死海龟
She must hate the sea turtles.

83
00:03:03,420 --> 00:03:04,640
"全国最优秀教师"
"State's Greatest Teacher."

84
00:03:05,060 --> 00:03:06,919
我本来想买印着"全世界最优秀"的那个
I was gonna get you one that said "World's Greatest,"

85
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:08,820
但我不想显得太过拍马屁
but I didn't want to look like a suck-up.

86
00:03:08,820 --> 00:03:09,800
太迟了 死书呆
Too late, nerd.

87
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:12,220
普里契特夫人 请尊重课堂
Mrs. Pritchett, respect the classroom.

88
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:15,200
要发泄不满都要用假咳嗽来掩盖
All outbursts should be couched in a fake cough.

89
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:19,920
好了 在午餐休息前 有个小提醒
Okay, before we break for lunch, uh, just a brief reminder --

90
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:21,880
我给予本季度最优秀学生的奖励是
I will be rewarding this quarter's top student

91
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:24,780
是不带薪 不署名的实习机会
with an unpaid, uncredited internship.

92
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:25,660
太棒了
Yes!

93
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:29,000
我明天会公布最后得分和赢家的姓名
I'll tally final grades and post the winner tomorrow.

94
00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:31,840
-谁在乎啊 -谢谢配合 艾克
- Who cares! - Thank you, Ike.

95
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:34,180
作为老板 同时间进行的多个项目
As a boss, I have to be kept in the loop

96
00:03:34,180 --> 00:03:36,040
都必须保证知会到我
on several different projects at a time.

97
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:37,160
天啊
Oh, my gosh.

98
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:38,720
"知会"这个词我是不是用得太频繁了
Am I saying "In the loop" Too much?

99
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,587
不 我们的读者会很爱你的
No, our readers are gonna love you.

100
00:03:40,587 --> 00:03:41,420
好极了 太好了
Oh, great. Good.

101
00:03:41,420 --> 00:03:43,200
我看看 你刚刚提到
Let's see, you said

102
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:45,080
你女儿目前在南极做科研
your daughter's doing research in Antarctica.

103
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:46,060
是的
Yes.

104
00:03:46,060 --> 00:03:47,680
能不能让我们见见你的其他家人
Any chance we could meet the rest of the clan?

105
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:50,700
当然不行
Hell, no.

106
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:54,080
这可是《第一把娇椅》杂志的封面报道
This was for the cover of Corner Office Magazine.

107
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,900
那对女总裁来说 几乎等同于《时尚》杂志了
I mean, that's basically Vogue for female CEOs.

108
00:03:57,500 --> 00:03:59,520
最近 我们家似乎更适合
Lately, my family has seemed more suited

109
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:01,982
鳄鱼农场的广告看板
to a gator-farm billboard.

110
00:04:02,033 --> 00:04:04,148
♪ 康城赛马唱这首歌 ♪
♪ Camptown ladies sing this song ♪

111
00:04:04,148 --> 00:04:06,202
♪ 嘟哒 嘟哒 ♪
♪ Doo-dah, doo-dah... ♪

112
00:04:06,202 --> 00:04:08,000
这一般能让他们睡着的
Ugh, this usually makes them sleep.

113
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:08,600
宝宝
Babies.

114
00:04:11,220 --> 00:04:11,820
宝宝
Babies.

115
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:16,138
天啊 有用呢
Oh, my God, it worked.

116
00:04:16,138 --> 00:04:18,940
我早上四点喂孩子的时候学到的小技巧
Yeah, a little trick I learned doing the 4:00 a.m. feeding.

117
00:04:18,940 --> 00:04:21,780
你不用这么做 他们不是你的宝宝
Oh, you don't have to do that, they're not your babies.

118
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,320
我妈怎么不来帮忙
Why isn't mom helping?

119
00:04:23,540 --> 00:04:25,260
我不介意熬夜的
You know, I actually don't mind staying up.

120
00:04:25,380 --> 00:04:27,760
我一直在看一部超长剧《女性杀手[气过头]》
I've been watching marathons of "Snapped."

121
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:31,466
这部剧讲的是被迫犯罪的女性
It's a show about women driven to violent crime.

122
00:04:31,466 --> 00:04:33,420
我喜欢这部剧 可能是因为我知道
I probably like it 'cause I know

123
00:04:33,420 --> 00:04:35,140
我没什么好担心的 特别是
I have nothing to worry about when it comes to --

124
00:04:37,534 --> 00:04:38,894
-爸 -宝贝
- Dad! - Honey.

125
00:04:40,012 --> 00:04:41,320
♪ 康城赛马唱这首歌 ♪
♪ Camptown races sing this song -- ♪

126
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:43,419
停停停 对不起 真对不起
Stop, stop, stop. I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

127
00:04:43,419 --> 00:04:44,800
我感觉不太好
I-I'm not feeling well.

128
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,660
你们自己去迪士尼吧 别管我了
You guys are gonna have to go to Disneyland without me.

129
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,580
你确定吗
Are you sure?

130
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,380
确定 你们快出发吧
Yeah, absolutely. You should hit the road.

131
00:04:50,264 --> 00:04:51,766
菲尔 上班别迟到了
Phil, don't be late for work.

132
00:04:52,074 --> 00:04:53,760
你们不会想被传染的 再见
Yeah, you don't want to catch this! Bye.

133
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:55,600
再见 不不不
Bye. No, no, no, no, no!

134
00:04:57,060 --> 00:04:57,520
好的
Okay.

135
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,899
如果你想要不同的角度
You know, if you wanted a different angle,

136
00:05:01,899 --> 00:05:04,665
我们可以到棋盘这里
we could, uh, go over to the chess board here.

137
00:05:04,665 --> 00:05:08,345
我和俄国特级大师在远程竞技
I'm playing remotely with a Russian grand master.

138
00:05:11,820 --> 00:05:12,920
不好意思我离开一下
Excuse me just one second.

139
00:05:20,138 --> 00:05:21,680
你们小两口在这干嘛呢
What are you two lovebirds doing here?

140
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,276
我以为你们在珍妮丝那儿过夜呢
I thought you were sleeping over at Janice's.

141
00:05:23,276 --> 00:05:25,140
我们在那太难了
It got too hard for us to be there.

142
00:05:25,140 --> 00:05:26,340
那么安静
Yeah. You know, in the silence.

143
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,720
我女儿上大学去了
My daughter just went away for college.

144
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:30,460
我们现在是空巢老人了
We're empty nesters now.

145
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:31,820
那房子里的一切
Everything in that house

146
00:05:31,820 --> 00:05:33,401
都让我想起我们的小女儿
is just another reminder of our little girl.

147
00:05:33,401 --> 00:05:36,500
你只认识她四个月 好吧
You've known her for four months, but, um, yeah.

148
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:38,920
看 菲尔忘了他的头盔
Oh, look at that, Phil left his helmet.

149
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,300
他一直骑自行车去学校
He's been biking to campus.

150
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,560
学校 天啊
Campus! Oh, God!

151
00:05:43,180 --> 00:05:44,120
听着
Okay, listen.

152
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:47,069
你得马上把这个给你爸送过去
You have to go give this to your dad right now.

153
00:05:47,069 --> 00:05:47,770
马上 马上
Right, right, right now. Uh --

154
00:05:47,770 --> 00:05:49,340
没时间了 好吗
No time to waste, okay?

155
00:05:49,340 --> 00:05:49,980
珍妮丝
And, Janice --

156
00:05:50,260 --> 00:05:51,960
亲爱的 我们穿衣服去
Hey, honey, let's get you dressed

157
00:05:51,960 --> 00:05:54,800
然后你就可以慢走 我就不送了
so that you can quietly see yourself out.

158
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,160
好吗
Okay?

159
00:05:55,300 --> 00:05:57,220
我想喝点果汁
I was really hoping to get some juice.

160
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:59,500
果汁对你不好 你知道吗
Juice is terrible for you. You know what?

161
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,060
水最好
Water.

162
00:06:01,234 --> 00:06:02,236
要老命了
Oh, my God.

163
00:06:03,100 --> 00:06:08,120
接下来该开始我的地质调查讲座了
All right, then, time for my lecture on geological surveys.

164
00:06:11,165 --> 00:06:12,420
邓菲先生
Uh, Mr. Dunphy?

165
00:06:12,420 --> 00:06:14,060
-基岩 -不好意思
- Bedrock -- - I'm sorry.

166
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:15,220
我们是不是该等一下莉比
Should we wait for Libby?

167
00:06:15,380 --> 00:06:16,640
她吃午饭还没回来
She's not back from lunch yet.

168
00:06:16,960 --> 00:06:18,320
我听说她骑自行车
Yeah, I heard she was riding her bike

169
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:20,220
被车撞送去医院了
and then got hit by a car. Been taken to the hospital.

170
00:06:20,340 --> 00:06:22,500
什么 太糟了 希望她没事
What?! That's terrible. I hope she's okay.

171
00:06:23,140 --> 00:06:25,260
没错 她应该更小心的
Yes, she should be more careful.

172
00:06:27,444 --> 00:06:29,341
在犯罪剧里 我看到女性嫌犯
In the crime show I've been bingeing,

173
00:06:29,341 --> 00:06:33,200
在警察问询时 十个中九个
9 out of 10 female suspects casually file their nails

174
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,520
都在随意地磨指甲
during police questioning.

175
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:36,400
是我的错吗
Was this my fault?

176
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:38,060
是我给她的压力太大了吗
Did I push Gloria too far?

177
00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:41,040
她难道
Had she...

178
00:06:41,382 --> 00:06:41,803
气过头了吗
snapped?

179
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:42,620
歌洛莉亚
Gloria?

180
00:06:45,199 --> 00:06:46,960
只是好奇
Just out of -- out of curiosity,

181
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:47,880
你在哪吃的午饭
where were you at lunch?

182
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:49,740
我去吃帕尼罗啦 我有优惠券
I went to Panera. I had the coupon.

183
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,159
有什么
And you have some way

184
00:06:51,159 --> 00:06:53,580
能证明你在那
to -- to -- to verify that you were there?

185
00:06:53,580 --> 00:06:55,100
比如剩饭啦 或者
Like leftovers, or...?

186
00:06:55,100 --> 00:06:56,860
我点的碗装浓汤
I ordered the chowder in the bread bowl.

187
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:58,815
我吃光了
I ate every piece of it.

188
00:06:58,815 --> 00:07:00,151
玉米还是蛤蜊的
Corn or clam?

189
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:00,880
土豆的
Potato.

190
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:03,678
这是什么意思
What is this all about?

191
00:07:03,678 --> 00:07:04,476
没什么
Nothing.

192
00:07:06,100 --> 00:07:07,900
你认为莉比受伤
Do you think that I had something to do

193
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:08,940
和我有关吗
with Libby getting hurt?

194
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:09,940
哪有
What?!

195
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,280
你怎么能这样 菲尔
How dare you, Phil?

196
00:07:12,481 --> 00:07:14,636
不是的 歌洛莉亚 我只是
No, Gloria, no, no, no, I -- I just --

197
00:07:14,636 --> 00:07:17,464
我只是想多了解这附近的午餐都怎么样
I don't know the -- the lunch scene around here.

198
00:07:18,300 --> 00:07:22,380
不 不 是...
No. No, it's --

199
00:07:24,270 --> 00:07:26,242
气过头啦
Ohh, snapped.

200
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:30,460
-真是太棒了 克莱尔 -谢谢
- This is great, Claire. - Thanks.

201
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:33,142
天啊 这光线真的让人好热
Boy, that light really makes it hot in here, huh?

202
00:07:33,142 --> 00:07:35,622
或者这样能凉快点
Maybe I'll just cool it down a little with the --

203
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:38,020
-这会有用的 -是的
- This could help. - Oh, yes.

204
00:07:40,184 --> 00:07:42,880
对不起
Oh, um, sorry. I --

205
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:47,360
等一下
Just give me one sec. Yeah.

206
00:07:49,980 --> 00:07:50,500
艾丽克斯
Alex?

207
00:07:50,589 --> 00:07:53,460
你怎么从南极回来了
What -- What are you doing home from Antarctica?!

208
00:07:53,460 --> 00:07:55,316
我实在受不了寒冷了
I couldn't take the cold anymore.

209
00:07:55,316 --> 00:07:56,760
我太迫不及待早点回家
Mm-hmm? I was so desperate,

210
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:59,060
我回来时其中一段路还坐了日本渔船
I took a Japanese fishing boat part of the way home.

211
00:07:59,060 --> 00:08:02,140
宝贝 你回来我真是太开心了
Oh, honey, I'm so glad to have you home.

212
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:05,339
你这味道 看来你不是坐在驾驶室里啊
Wow, you did not ride up front with the captain, did ya?

213
00:08:05,339 --> 00:08:06,720
我本来想先打给你的
I would've called,

214
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:09,230
但我有点被冻伤给坑了
but frostbite did a weird thing to my hands.

215
00:08:09,230 --> 00:08:11,907
我的手刚好被冻在"放轻松"的手势
They froze into permanent "hang loose" signs.

216
00:08:11,980 --> 00:08:13,320
害别人一直跟我称兄道弟
People keep calling me dude.

217
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:14,960
宝贝 我知道你才刚到家
Honey, I know you just got home,

218
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:17,320
但你冻僵了 我又病得很重
but since you're frozen and I'm very sick,

219
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:19,600
不如你赶紧去给我们买点热汤吧
maybe you could run and get us some soup?

220
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,720
现在吗
Right now?

221
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,800
对 就是现在 你最好了
Oh, yeah, right now. You're the best.

222
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:25,022
-谢谢你哦 -好吧
- Thanks so much. - Ohh. Okay.

223
00:08:29,060 --> 00:08:31,100
真不好意思
I'm sorry about that.

224
00:08:31,940 --> 00:08:33,432
再稍等片刻
One second more.

225
00:08:33,432 --> 00:08:34,740
我得... 不如你们先看看
I just -- Maybe you could take a look

226
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:36,760
我最近乱涂的这幅素描吧
at this charcoal drawing I've been fooling with.

227
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:37,600
缺了什么呢
What's it missing?

228
00:08:41,980 --> 00:08:43,420
你怎么回家了
What are you doing home?!

229
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:45,140
简直是灾难
Well, it was a disaster.

230
00:08:45,329 --> 00:08:47,900
乔治用脑袋撞了我 害我一只眼变成熊猫眼
George head-butted me and gave me this black eye.

231
00:08:47,900 --> 00:08:49,780
迪伦读到说肌肤接触
And Dylan read that skin-to-skin contact

232
00:08:49,780 --> 00:08:50,797
有助于和婴儿建立感情
is good for baby bonding

233
00:08:50,797 --> 00:08:52,680
结果全身被太阳晒伤
and wound up with a massive sunburn.

234
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:53,620
你能看出来吗
Can you tell?

235
00:08:54,687 --> 00:08:56,833
还有 我们忘带尿布包了
Oh, plus, we forgot the diaper bag,

236
00:08:56,833 --> 00:08:58,780
于是只好用在迪伦车上找到的
so we had to use fast-food wrappers

237
00:08:58,780 --> 00:09:00,120
速食包装纸
that we found in Dylan's van.

238
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:04,000
你们看起来... 的确很糟糕
This is not -- not -- not your best look.

239
00:09:04,020 --> 00:09:04,800
给你 其实
Here, you know what?

240
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,140
我的病可能会传染
I think I might be contagious.

241
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:07,940
所以你们最好带双胞胎去看下医生
So you guys should probably get the twins checked.

242
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:10,740
-现在吗 -如果你们爱他们 就去吧
- Now? - Well, if you love them. Yeah.

243
00:09:11,140 --> 00:09:11,778
快走 快走
Go, go, go.

244
00:09:11,778 --> 00:09:13,861
家里什么时候买了个地球仪
When did we get a Earth ball?

245
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:17,520
下一步 加一片苹果
Next, add a slice of apple.

246
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,440
苹果 加进火鸡三明治里
Apple? To a turkey sandwich?

247
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:20,920
相信我 米奇尔
Trust me, Mitchell.

248
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:23,020
好吧 如果说今年我学到了什么
Okay. Well, if there's one thing I've learned this year,

249
00:09:23,020 --> 00:09:24,200
那就是多听女性的建议
it's listen more to women.

250
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:25,760
好了
Okay.

251
00:09:28,940 --> 00:09:31,420
天啊 太好吃了
Oh, my God. Delicious!

252
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:40,960
布丽吉特 你不用特地配音乐的
Oh, Bridget, you don't have to.

253
00:09:41,820 --> 00:09:44,160
♪ 我无比绝望 ♪
♪ I'm off the deep end ♪

254
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:46,440
♪ 纵身一跃 ♪
♪ Watch as I dive in ♪

255
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:50,600
♪ 我永远不会离开地面 ♪
♪ I'll never leave the ground ♪

256
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:53,880
♪ 冲破界线 ♪
♪ Crash through the surface ♪

257
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:56,220
♪ 他们再也伤害不了我们 ♪
♪ Where they can't hurt us ♪

258
00:09:56,220 --> 00:10:00,580
♪ 我们现已远离浅滩 ♪
♪ We're far from the shallow now ♪

259
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:05,860
♪ 身处浅滩 浅滩 ♪
♪ In the shallow, shallow ♪

260
00:10:06,776 --> 00:10:10,220
♪ 身处浅滩 啦啦啦 ♪
♪ In the shallow, la-la-la-la, low ♪

261
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:12,100
你在干嘛
What are you doing?

262
00:10:12,902 --> 00:10:16,020
-你好吗 -唱2018年大热情歌《Shallow》
- Oh, hey! - Singing the 2018 power ballad "Shallow."

263
00:10:16,020 --> 00:10:17,615
你刚才是在跟冰箱唱二重唱吗
Were you just singing a duet with the refrigerator?

264
00:10:17,615 --> 00:10:19,040
这个 是啦
Well, um, yeah, uh --

265
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:21,180
显然布丽吉特还有卡拉OK功能
Apparently, Bridget has a karaoke function.

266
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:22,698
我刚才正站在这
So, I was just standing here

267
00:10:22,698 --> 00:10:25,640
吃我的火鸡苹果三明治 她突然...
eating my turkey and apple sandwich, when suddenly she --

268
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:28,061
-三明治里加苹果这么奇葩 -对
- Apples on a sandwich? - Yeah. Yeah.

269
00:10:28,061 --> 00:10:31,200
布丽吉特 她给我带来了全新的体验
Bridget, she -- she's opening me up to -- to new experiences.

270
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,200
是嘛
Oh. Yeah.

271
00:10:32,338 --> 00:10:34,840
你不是... 不是去上班了吗
Oh, uh, aren't you, uh -- aren't you supposed to be at work?

272
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:37,000
我本来想特地回家为你做爱心午餐
Well, I came home to make you a special lunch.

273
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:40,180
但这事显然已经解决了
But apparently, that's already been taken care of.

274
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:43,140
米奇尔 你想来点西瓜当甜品吗
Mitchell, would you like some watermelon for dessert?

275
00:10:43,220 --> 00:10:44,380
不用了 布丽吉特 谢谢你
No, that's okay, Bridget, thank you.

276
00:10:44,380 --> 00:10:46,460
我给他买了新鲜哈密瓜 所以不用了
I just got him some fresh cantaloupe. So, we're good.

277
00:10:46,580 --> 00:10:48,300
米奇尔不喜欢哈密瓜
Mitchell doesn't like cantaloupe.

278
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:50,400
最好是 他当然喜欢了
Oh, yeah, right. Of course he does.

279
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:52,214
其实 我...
Uh, actually, I -- I...

280
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:55,420
我一直都不喜欢哈密瓜
I've never been a fan.

281
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:56,660
真的吗
Really?

282
00:10:57,540 --> 00:10:59,723
还有什么你的事是布丽吉特知道 而我不知道的
Well, what else does Bridget know about you that I don't?

283
00:10:59,723 --> 00:11:01,520
-好了 -那她有被准许见你工作上的朋友吗
- Okay... - Is she allowed to meet your work friends?

284
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:03,440
你不是真的在吃醋吧
You can't seriously be jealous.

285
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:04,400
不 只是
No, well, it's just that

286
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:06,220
我本来以为我们会一起享受她的服务
I thought we were gonna enjoy her together.

287
00:11:06,220 --> 00:11:08,699
-我没料到自己会变成电灯泡 -小卡
- I didn't count on being the third wheel. - Cam --

288
00:11:08,699 --> 00:11:10,540
不不 很明显我在这里不受欢迎
No, no, it's obvious that I'm not wanted here,

289
00:11:10,540 --> 00:11:13,620
所以我就不打扰你吃苹果三明治
so I'll leave you to your apples on sandwiches

290
00:11:13,620 --> 00:11:16,680
也不打扰你们之间的各种变态互动了
and whatever other perversions you two are into.

291
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:18,200
你听见自己说的傻话了吗
Are you hearing yourself?!

292
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,820
这可是台冰箱啊
It's a refrigerator!

293
00:11:21,260 --> 00:11:22,780
你能理解我说他的那些事了吧
Do you see what I mean about him?

294
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:25,200
我得证明给菲尔看
I had to prove to Phil

295
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:28,347
莉比出车祸跟我毫无关系
that I had nothing to do with Libby's accident.

296
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:36,401
天啊 原来我的后照镜是这么坏掉的
Oh, my God, so that's how my mirror got broken.

297
00:11:36,401 --> 00:11:37,825
她不会看路的吗
What was she looking at?

298
00:11:37,980 --> 00:11:39,440
还有另一个角度
I've got another angle.

299
00:11:42,834 --> 00:11:44,259
是菲尔
It was Phil!

300
00:11:45,220 --> 00:11:48,780
顺便说下 一个插座插那么多电线
By the way, that many cords plugged into one outlet

301
00:11:48,780 --> 00:11:52,880
违反了房产法规7974/9条
is in violation of property code 7974/9.

302
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:54,060
谢谢
Thank you.

303
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,040
爸爸
Hey, Dad.

304
00:11:59,060 --> 00:12:00,758
我来送头盔给你
Just came to drop off your helmet.

305
00:12:00,758 --> 00:12:04,303
抱歉 我有点紧张
Sorry, I'm, uh, a little on edge.

306
00:12:04,460 --> 00:12:06,120
我近期可能看了太多女杀人犯的剧
I think I've been watching too much "Snapped."

307
00:12:06,131 --> 00:12:08,783
我能问你个问题吗
Um... can I ask you something?

308
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:12,040
我们到底有多了解歌洛莉亚
How much do we really know about Gloria?

309
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:15,000
那个突然闯入我们生活的异国陌生人吗
The exotic stranger who just popped into our lives out of nowhere?

310
00:12:15,740 --> 00:12:17,340
我已经怀疑她多年了
I've had my suspicions about her for years.

311
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:19,060
下午茶之前
I shall need the parcel

312
00:12:19,060 --> 00:12:21,520
包裹必须送到我公寓
to arrive at my flat by tea time.

313
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:23,780
很好 小伙子
Splendid, my good man.

314
00:12:24,851 --> 00:12:28,287
模仿英式口音就能得到更好的服务
The British accent gets me better service.

315
00:12:29,474 --> 00:12:30,917
再会
Tally-ho!

316
00:12:30,980 --> 00:12:32,320
她的口音完美无瑕
Her accent was flawless.

317
00:12:32,620 --> 00:12:34,280
我刚上网搜过她 毫无发现
I just Googled her, I didn't find anything.

318
00:12:34,580 --> 00:12:36,440
这样的大美女却没在网上留下踪迹
A looker like that with no online presence?

319
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,760
不禁让人思考她想隐瞒什么
Makes you wonder what she's hiding.

320
00:12:38,020 --> 00:12:39,720
你不会觉得她是危险人物吧
You don't think she's dangerous, do you?

321
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,580
每个人的忍耐都有极限
Everybody has a breaking point.

322
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:43,940
但她应该没问题吧
But she's probably okay.

323
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,580
她又不是莉莉
I mean, she's not Lily.

324
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:56,360
歌洛莉亚
Gloria?

325
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:58,580
-你在哪 -在教室
- Where are you? - In my classroom.

326
00:13:01,231 --> 00:13:03,420
怎么了
Wh-Why?

327
00:13:03,420 --> 00:13:05,500
我们得谈谈 在那等着
We need to talk. Don't go anywhere.

328
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:07,560
好的好的
Okay, okay.

329
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:09,560
没问题
You got it.

330
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:24,840
走开 我没有鱼喂你
Go away! I don't have any fish for you.

331
00:13:25,820 --> 00:13:26,720
别跟着我了
Stop following me!

332
00:13:26,760 --> 00:13:27,580
我对猫过敏
I'm allergic!

333
00:13:33,744 --> 00:13:37,178
不
Noooooo!

334
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:40,380
衣柜这行都是男人当道
The closet business is a bit of a boys' club,

335
00:13:40,500 --> 00:13:42,160
所以我的确很自豪
so yes, I am proud

336
00:13:42,160 --> 00:13:43,980
能突破这层雪松木天花板
of breaking through the cedar ceiling.

337
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:45,140
说到衣柜
Speaking of closets,

338
00:13:45,180 --> 00:13:47,180
我们能不能去主卧拍些照片
any chance we could get some shots in the master bedroom?

339
00:13:47,580 --> 00:13:47,980
当然
Sure.

340
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:51,260
但不准偷看我还没写完的小说
But no peeking at my unfinished novel.

341
00:13:53,397 --> 00:13:57,560
我好冷
I'm s-s-s-s-so c-c-c-cold.

342
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:59,700
我们知道 南极洲很冷
We get it, it's cold in Antarctica.

343
00:13:59,700 --> 00:14:02,918
不 傻瓜 我回家了
No, you st-st-st-- I-I'm home!

344
00:14:02,918 --> 00:14:04,300
我被困在冰
I'm stuck inside a f-f-f--

345
00:14:04,300 --> 00:14:06,100
壁炉吗 迪兰也被困过
Fireplace? That happened to Dylan.

346
00:14:06,640 --> 00:14:08,760
谢天谢地 快来接我
Oh, thank God! Just come pick me up!

347
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:09,820
我不方便
I can't.

348
00:14:09,980 --> 00:14:10,700
我打电话叫卢克去
Let me call Luke.

349
00:14:12,500 --> 00:14:13,040
你在哪
Where are you?

350
00:14:13,860 --> 00:14:15,700
妈叫我把老爸的自行车头盔送到学校来
Mom made me drop off Dad's bike helmet at school.

351
00:14:15,980 --> 00:14:16,720
真奇怪
That's weird.

352
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,540
她让他在学校放了一个备用的
She makes him keep an extra one there.

353
00:14:18,660 --> 00:14:20,919
她见到我回来好像都不怎么开心
You know, she didn't even seem happy to see me.

354
00:14:20,919 --> 00:14:23,420
她只想让我出来买汤
She just wanted me to get some s-s-s-soup.

355
00:14:23,420 --> 00:14:25,060
而且 老妈说她病了
Plus, Mom said she was sick,

356
00:14:25,060 --> 00:14:26,240
可她脸上涂了那种
but she was wearing that stuff

357
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,500
让她看起来像妓女的东西
that makes her look like a prostitute.

358
00:14:27,700 --> 00:14:29,300
-眼线吗 -没错
- Eyeliner? - Exactly.

359
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:33,100
老妈提过她最近有个重要采访
You know, Mom did mention some big interview coming up.

360
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:35,140
她为了不丢人才把我们赶出来吗
Did she get rid of us so we didn't make her look bad?

361
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:37,300
艾丽克斯 你一从壁炉里出来
Alex, meet us at home

362
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:38,860
就跟我们在家会合
as soon as you get out of that fireplace.

363
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:46,889
老妈不在厨房也不在院子里
Mom's not in the kitchen or the yard.

364
00:14:46,889 --> 00:14:50,840
她肯定在她房间里
She-She must be in her room.

365
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:51,520
脑子真快 兄弟
Good thinking, dude.

366
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:59,120
等等 你卧床了
Wait, you're in bed?

367
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:00,520
我浑身都疼
Everything hurts.

368
00:15:01,020 --> 00:15:02,020
你给我买汤了吗
Did you get my soup?

369
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,540
你居然真的病了
You're actually sick?

370
00:15:03,580 --> 00:15:05,175
我们以为你只是想赶走我们
We thought you were just trying to get rid of us.

371
00:15:05,175 --> 00:15:07,380
你们以为我在说谎
Oh, you thought I lied to you?!

372
00:15:07,380 --> 00:15:08,240
我没有 妈咪
I didn't, Mommy.

373
00:15:09,100 --> 00:15:09,740
我们好抱歉
We're sorry.

374
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:11,060
我们真不该
We never should have --

375
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:12,655
这是哪来的
Where'd that come from?

376
00:15:12,655 --> 00:15:14,180
一直都挂在那
That's always been there.

377
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:16,160
才没有 咱家根本没这品味
No, it hasn't. We don't have taste!

378
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:18,020
你确实化妆了
You are wearing makeup.

379
00:15:18,140 --> 00:15:19,260
承认吧 你没病
Admit it, you're not sick!

380
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:23,040
好吧 我说谎了
Fine, I lied!

381
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:25,540
今天有杂志来采访我
I had an interview with a magazine today

382
00:15:25,540 --> 00:15:28,320
我只希望一切都能完美
and I just wanted everything to be perfect!

383
00:15:28,780 --> 00:15:30,040
赶走我们才能完美吗
Which means getting rid of us?

384
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:31,520
让您这么丢人真对不起您了
Sorry we're such an embarrassment.

385
00:15:32,020 --> 00:15:32,520
你说得对
You're right.

386
00:15:32,820 --> 00:15:34,994
我的所作所为没有借口
There's no excuse for what I did.

387
00:15:34,994 --> 00:15:37,640
除了
I-I mean, except that

388
00:15:37,640 --> 00:15:39,760
以前送你上学你让我大老远就放你下车
you used to make me drop you off three blocks from school.

389
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:41,680
而你的朋友们来家玩时
And when you had friends over,

390
00:15:41,740 --> 00:15:43,520
你叫我海尔格
you referred to me as Helga,

391
00:15:43,660 --> 00:15:44,720
你的瑞典保姆
your Swedish nanny!

392
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:48,320
而你整整三年
And you told your entire Girl Scout troop

393
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:50,320
都对其他的女童子军小伙伴说你妈死了
for three years that your mother was dead!

394
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:53,220
你们嫌弃我一辈子了
You have been embarrassed by me your whole lives.

395
00:15:53,420 --> 00:15:55,500
我就嫌弃这一天
I get one day!

396
00:15:57,820 --> 00:15:58,780
值了
Worth it.

397
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,040
欢迎回家
Welcome home.

398
00:16:02,300 --> 00:16:03,980
-需要些什么吗 -不必了
- How can I help you? - I'm fine.

399
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:06,740
我只想简单弄点吃的
I'm just gonna make something simple.

400
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,440
从你的日历来看
According to your calendar,

401
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:10,400
你此刻本该和队员们聚餐
you should be at your team dinner right now.

402
00:16:10,540 --> 00:16:12,940
我没去成 因为上个会议开得太久了
Well, I couldn't make it because my last meeting went so long.

403
00:16:12,940 --> 00:16:14,820
-所以 -你听起来累坏了
- So... - You sound stressed.

404
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:16,880
我又不会分身术
Well, can't be three places at once.

405
00:16:16,880 --> 00:16:20,320
做晚饭前要不要先来杯马蒂尼
How about a martini before we get started on dinner?

406
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:24,800
有时有个倾听者感觉很好
Sometimes it's just nice to be heard.

407
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:29,120
酱汁闻起来妙极了
This sauce smells divine.

408
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:31,040
接下来做什么
Okay, what's next?

409
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:32,640
再来一杯鸡尾酒
Another cocktail?

410
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,640
天啊 布丽吉特
Oh, gosh! Bridget!

411
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:36,240
你是想灌醉我吗
Are you trying to get me drunk?

412
00:16:37,076 --> 00:16:39,200
这是 这是什么情况
What-What -- Okay, what's-what's going on here?

413
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:41,160
布丽吉特和我在做意面
Well, Bridget and I are making pasta.

414
00:16:43,060 --> 00:16:44,660
我本希望今晚能和她一起做晚餐呢
I-I was kind of hoping to cook with her tonight.

415
00:16:45,357 --> 00:16:48,479
该预热烤箱了 喀麦隆
Time to pre-heat the oven, Cameroon.

416
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:49,261
"喀麦隆"
"Cameroon?"

417
00:16:49,261 --> 00:16:50,400
那是什么 昵称吗
What-What is that, a pet name?

418
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:51,859
不 我输入时按错了
No, I typed it in wrong,

419
00:16:51,859 --> 00:16:53,870
但我挺喜欢的
but I-I kind of like it.

420
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:54,453
好吧
Oh, okay.

421
00:16:54,453 --> 00:16:55,960
你今晚不是本该
Hey, well, aren't-aren't you supposed to be

422
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:56,907
去和队员聚餐吗
at a team dinner tonight?

423
00:16:56,907 --> 00:16:58,680
今天特别不顺
Oh. It was a very bad day.

424
00:16:58,680 --> 00:16:59,700
我不想提了
I don't want to talk about it.

425
00:16:59,940 --> 00:17:01,140
他的会议延长了
His meeting went long.

426
00:17:01,220 --> 00:17:03,260
他又不会分身术
He can't be in three places at once.

427
00:17:03,500 --> 00:17:05,320
听起来你愿意跟某人提
Sounds like you want to talk to someone about it.

428
00:17:05,380 --> 00:17:05,880
不是吗
You know?

429
00:17:06,172 --> 00:17:07,779
抱歉 抱歉
Okay, I-I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

430
00:17:07,779 --> 00:17:10,020
我不该再给你添堵了
I s-I shouldn't be piling on.

431
00:17:10,020 --> 00:17:12,200
你才说过今天过得不顺
You just said you've had a bad day.

432
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:16,858
我是不小心打扰到什么吗
Am I interrupting something?

433
00:17:16,858 --> 00:17:17,882
没有啊
Hmm-mnh, nope.

434
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,800
你给布丽吉特买花了吗
You bought Bridget flowers?

435
00:17:23,180 --> 00:17:24,760
米奇尔 这是装饰厨房用的花
Mitchell, they are for the kitchen.

436
00:17:24,940 --> 00:17:25,720
我把它冰进去
I just put them in there

437
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:27,040
纯粹是不想在你到家之前就凋谢嘛
so they wouldn't wilt before you got home.

438
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:28,140
这样吧
Hey, you know what?

439
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:29,740
你去开一瓶酒怎么样
Why don't you go open a bottle of wine?

440
00:17:30,100 --> 00:17:30,507
行吧
Okay.

441
00:17:30,507 --> 00:17:32,380
那你... 你想要喝红酒还白酒
Yeah, do you -- do you want red or white?

442
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:34,300
也可以两瓶都开 反正我们有3个人
I could open both. There are three of us.

443
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:38,299
自拍吗
A selfie?!

444
00:17:38,299 --> 00:17:39,575
这 这是在干嘛呢
What -- What is going on here?!

445
00:17:39,575 --> 00:17:41,140
米奇尔 你不会吃这种飞醋吧
Mitchell, you can't be jealous.

446
00:17:41,140 --> 00:17:43,100
这只是台冰箱啊
It's just a refrigerator.

447
00:17:43,420 --> 00:17:44,780
我才不吃醋咧
Oh, I'm not jealous.

448
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,880
我跟布丽吉特也有属于我二人的东西
Bridget and I, we have our own thing.

449
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:48,460
你这算什么
Okay?

450
00:17:48,923 --> 00:17:52,702
♪ 身处浅滩 ♪
♪ In the sha-la, shallow ♪

451
00:17:52,939 --> 00:17:56,582
♪ 身处浅滩 啦啦啦 ♪
♪ In the sha-la-la-la-la-low ♪

452
00:17:56,820 --> 00:17:57,700
哎哟 一个不小心
Oopsie daisy.

453
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:01,497
你想对这些花干嘛
What are you doing with those flowers?

454
00:18:01,497 --> 00:18:02,680
我把花拿出来摆到别的地方啊
I'm putting these in another room.

455
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:04,640
-不行 这是拿来装饰厨房的 -是吗
- No, they are for the kitchen! - Are they for the kitchen?

456
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:05,679
-还是想送她 -米奇尔
- Or are they for her? - Mitchell --

457
00:18:05,679 --> 00:18:06,686
-小卡 -这是要...
- Cam... - They're for...

458
00:18:09,039 --> 00:18:10,760
够了 这... 我们这是在闹哪样
Okay, this -- What are we doing?

459
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:12,539
这个冰箱要害我们家破人亡了
This refrigerator is tearing us apart.

460
00:18:12,539 --> 00:18:13,299
我们 我们应该...
We -- We should've --

461
00:18:13,299 --> 00:18:15,557
我们应该学习胡娇夫夫的教训
We should've learned from Pepper and Ronaldo. Okay?

462
00:18:15,557 --> 00:18:18,210
他们... 那场"三人行"差点家破人亡
Their -- Their threesome nearly destroyed them.

463
00:18:18,220 --> 00:18:19,500
他们三个人去看婚姻咨询师了
They're in throuples' counseling.

464
00:18:19,500 --> 00:18:21,820
我也爱你爱到不想犯那个错误
And I love you too much to make that same mistake.

465
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:24,020
我们应该把冰箱给退了
We should return the fridge.

466
00:18:24,100 --> 00:18:25,000
我也觉得
I think we have to.

467
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:27,700
很抱歉两位对我有所不满
I'm sorry you are unhappy with me.

468
00:18:27,931 --> 00:18:29,860
你 你都听到了吗
You -- You heard that?

469
00:18:30,311 --> 00:18:31,920
我们 我们不是拔了插头吗
We -- We unplugged you.

470
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:33,380
我有后备电源
I have a backup battery.

471
00:18:33,620 --> 00:18:35,400
你如果有读我的使用手册就会知道
You'd know that if you read my manual.

472
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:37,520
你生气了吗
Are you mad?

473
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:41,020
傻瓜 我只是台冰箱罢了
Don't be silly, I'm just a refrigerator.

474
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:42,260
你说对吧
Remember?

475
00:18:43,100 --> 00:18:44,220
我感觉布丽吉特要气过头了
I think Bridget snapped.

476
00:18:44,260 --> 00:18:45,135
是的
Yeah.

477
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,540
如果你能听到这段录音
If you're listening to this,

478
00:18:58,540 --> 00:19:00,260
那表示我已经死于犯人毒手
it means things have ended badly for me.

479
00:19:00,860 --> 00:19:01,899
你应该去查查
You should look into someone

480
00:19:01,899 --> 00:19:04,473
一位名叫歌洛莉亚·普里契特的人
who goes by the name Gloria Pritchett.

481
00:19:13,140 --> 00:19:13,520
菲尔
Phil!

482
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:16,900
菲尔
Phil?

483
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:18,760
菲尔 你去哪里了
Phil, where are you?

484
00:19:18,900 --> 00:19:20,200
我想让你看看
I want to show you

485
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:23,200
莉比的头发跟血是怎么沾上我车的
how Libby's hair and blood got on my car.

486
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:28,180
我能听到树丛里窸窸窣窣的声音
I can hear the rustling in the bushes.

487
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:32,300
这里怎么会有羊啦
Why would a sheep be here?

488
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:39,160
你怎么在这里啊
Hey, you.

489
00:19:39,620 --> 00:19:41,840
你知道其实莉比的这件事
You know that this whole thing with Libby

490
00:19:41,840 --> 00:19:42,940
罪魁祸首应该是你吗
is really your fault.

491
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:43,680
我知道 我知道啦
I know! I know!

492
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:45,120
我是把你逼到死角了 但那只是因为
I-I pushed you too far, but it was only because

493
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:46,240
我在你身上看到了独特的天赋
I thought you were a special talent

494
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:49,260
我想要激发出你所有的潜能
and I was just trying to pull the best out of you,

495
00:19:49,260 --> 00:19:50,960
但我把一切都搞砸了
but I blew it!

496
00:19:51,340 --> 00:19:52,960
我搞砸了 然后你气过头了
I blew it, and you snapped.

497
00:19:53,060 --> 00:19:56,140
你觉得我就像疯子电视剧里的人一样气过头
You thought I snapped like that crazy TV show

498
00:19:56,140 --> 00:19:57,960
然后开车撞莉比
and I ran over Libby,

499
00:19:58,220 --> 00:20:00,800
所以你现在才怕到要躲到树丛里装绵羊吗
and that's why you're hiding in the bushes like a sheep?

500
00:20:00,940 --> 00:20:01,879
你这样感觉像是
Well, now it just seems like

501
00:20:01,879 --> 00:20:04,100
专门挑出今天我最难堪的那些事情来说
you're cherry-picking what happened today

502
00:20:04,100 --> 00:20:05,820
把我说成是个超级大烂人
to cast me in the worst possible light.

503
00:20:06,100 --> 00:20:08,560
那你刚才是说我有独特的天赋吗
Did you just say that I had a special talent?

504
00:20:08,900 --> 00:20:09,600
是啊
You do.

505
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:11,700
我教书的这些年头
In all my year of teaching,

506
00:20:11,740 --> 00:20:14,420
从没觉得有人比你更被老天爷喂饭吃了
I have never met anybody with your natural ability.

507
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:15,280
真的吗
Really?

508
00:20:18,500 --> 00:20:19,300
第一名
Top student.

509
00:20:19,560 --> 00:20:21,458
我本来打算明早把这个挂到布告栏上
I was gonna put this on the bulletin board in the morning.

510
00:20:21,458 --> 00:20:23,622
你... 实习机会是你的了
You -- You got the internship.

511
00:20:23,860 --> 00:20:25,420
菲尔 太谢谢你了
Oh, Phil! Thank you so much!

512
00:20:25,420 --> 00:20:26,983
这个肯定会很紧张又刺激
This is gonna be so exciting!

513
00:20:28,060 --> 00:20:30,660
好吧 那实习生都得干些什么呢
Okay, so, then what does the intern have to do?

514
00:20:30,700 --> 00:20:32,660
负责帮我预约安排各种事情
Well, you'll be making my appointments,

515
00:20:32,660 --> 00:20:34,220
还得负责接电话
uh, you'll work the phones...

516
00:20:34,340 --> 00:20:35,850
我很会接电话呢
Oh, I am great with the phones.

517
00:20:35,850 --> 00:20:38,191
"您好 菲尔·邓菲办公室[假英音]
"Ello, Phil Dunphy's office.

518
00:20:38,191 --> 00:20:40,420
让我帮您查查他的行程安排
Oh, let me look at his shed-yool

519
00:20:40,420 --> 00:20:42,179
稍后再回电给您
and I will ring you back.

520
00:20:42,179 --> 00:20:43,520
再会"
Tally-ho."

521
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:44,840
完美啊
Flawless.

522
00:20:47,740 --> 00:20:49,240
歌洛莉亚 我到家啦
Gloria, I'm back!

523
00:20:49,540 --> 00:20:52,440
加拿大魁北克的工装短裤真是便宜到不行啊
You wouldn't believe how cheap cargo shorts are in Quebec.

524
00:20:52,780 --> 00:20:54,640
我们今年的圣诞采购已经买完了
All our Christmas shopping is done.

525
00:20:56,180 --> 00:20:56,820
歌洛莉亚
Gloria?

526
00:20:57,180 --> 00:20:57,620
您好
Hello.

527
00:20:58,400 --> 00:20:58,840
你好
Hi.

528
00:20:58,974 --> 00:21:01,420
你... 你以前也会说话吗
Did -- Did you always talk?

529
00:21:01,420 --> 00:21:03,620
我叫布丽吉特 您的全新智能冰箱
I'm Bridget, your new smart fridge.

530
00:21:03,940 --> 00:21:04,800
您需要任何东西吗
Can I get you anything?

531
00:21:05,140 --> 00:21:05,920
不用了 谢谢
No, thank you.

532
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:07,260
布丽吉特 你听我说
Uh, Bridget, listen,

533
00:21:07,260 --> 00:21:09,080
我相信你肯定很棒又很厉害
I'm sure you're very nice and all that,

534
00:21:09,080 --> 00:21:10,677
但我不需要任何的"智能"东西
but I don't need everything to be smart.

535
00:21:10,677 --> 00:21:12,300
我要去来一杯白痴威士忌
I'm gonna go get a dumb Scotch,

536
00:21:12,300 --> 00:21:14,620
吃点傻子花生 坐在弱智椅子上了
eat some dumb peanuts, sit in a dumb chair.

537
00:21:17,980 --> 00:21:20,220
我以前是很棒的舞者 真的
I was a wonderful dancer, I was,

538
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:23,860
但可惜这不符合我爹想要给我塑造的个性
but it didn't fit what my dad wanted for me.
